sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DevA as Developer A (Frontend & Product)
    participant DevB as Developer B (Backend, Data & AI)
    participant Contract as Shared API Contract (docs/API_CONTRACT.md)
    participant Git as Git Repo (integration branch)
    participant CI as GitHub Actions CI

    Note over DevA,DevB: Step 1: Interface Alignment
    DevA->>Contract: Reviews requested frontend payload fields
    DevB->>Contract: Validates Pydantic schemas & endpoint specifications
    DevA->>DevB: Approve API Contract v1.0

    Note over DevA,DevB: Step 2: Parallel Implementation
    DevA->>DevA: Develops Next.js UI using apiClient (mock/dev backend)
    DevB->>DevB: Implements FastAPI endpoints, SQLAlchemy models & RAG

    Note over DevA,DevB: Step 3: Local Quality Verification
    DevA->>DevA: Runs frontend test suite & typecheck
    DevB->>DevB: Runs pytest test suite & ruff linting

    Note over DevA,DevB: Step 4: Staging Integration
    DevB->>Git: PR feature/backend -> integration
    Git->>CI: Runs CI checks (pytest, lint)
    CI-->>Git: Pass
    DevA->>Git: Reviews & Approves Backend PR

    DevA->>Git: PR feature/frontend -> integration
    Git->>CI: Runs CI checks (tsc, tests)
    CI-->>Git: Pass
    DevB->>Git: Reviews & Approves Frontend PR

    Note over DevA,DevB: Step 5: End-to-End Milestone
    DevA->>DevB: Pair verify live data on http://localhost:3000
    DevB->>Git: Merge integration into main
